WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.563
"I wasn't running away!" Rapunzel cried.

2
00:00:04.564 --> 00:00:09.991
"I just wanted to see my parents!

3
00:00:09.992 --> 00:00:12.203
Please don't hurt them.

4
00:00:12.204 --> 00:00:14.746
They didn't see me!"

5
00:00:14.747 --> 00:00:20.343
"You broke your promise!" The witch snarled.

6
00:00:20.344 --> 00:00:23.483
She dragged Rapunzel away.

7
00:00:23.484 --> 00:00:25.896
The boy ran after them.

8
00:00:25.897 --> 00:00:29.943
"Stop! Let her go!"

9
00:00:29.944 --> 00:00:34.416
The boy grabbed Rapunzel's hand.

10
00:00:34.417 --> 00:00:37.571
But the witch shoved him aside.

11
00:00:37.572 --> 00:00:40.117
She pulled off her shawl.

12
00:00:40.118 --> 00:00:43.000
Then she tossed it on the ground.

13
00:00:43.001 --> 00:00:48.645
She pushed Rapunzel onto the shawl.

14
00:00:48.646 --> 00:00:53.923
Whoosh! They flew out of the city.

15
00:00:53.924 --> 00:00:57.361
"Where are we going?" Rapunzel cried.

16
00:00:57.362 --> 00:01:03.876
"To a safe place!" the witch said.

17
00:01:03.877 --> 00:01:09.896
Soon they were deep in the forest.

18
00:01:09.897 --> 00:01:18.163
Rapunzel saw a tower with no door.

19
00:01:18.164 --> 00:01:23.432
They flew in through a window.

20
00:01:23.433 --> 00:01:30.835
The witch laughed. "Welcome to your new home!"

21
00:01:30.836 --> 00:01:34.538
Rapunzel shivered.

22
00:01:34.539 --> 00:01:39.040
It was a cold, dark room.

23
00:01:39.041 --> 00:01:43.891
She wrapped her long braid around herself.

24
00:01:43.892 --> 00:01:48.027
"Witch, you cannot leave me here," Rapunzel said.

25
00:01:48.028 --> 00:01:50.537
"You are old and tired.

26
00:01:50.538 --> 00:01:53.697
You cannot tend the garden by yourself.

27
00:01:53.698 --> 00:01:57.383
And you need my help with the potions."

28
00:01:57.384 --> 00:01:59.941
The witch shrugged.

29
00:01:59.942 --> 00:02:04.024
"I will bring work for you each day.

30
00:02:04.025 --> 00:02:06.999
You can mix potions here.

31
00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:13.636
And I can tend the garden by myself."

32
00:02:13.637 --> 00:02:19.129
Rapunzel glared at her. "You are so mean.

33
00:02:19.130 --> 00:02:21.703
You stole me from my parents.

34
00:02:21.704 --> 00:02:25.611
But I will always love them while you . . .

35
00:02:25.612 --> 00:02:29.269
You have no one who loves you!"

36
00:02:29.270 --> 00:02:34.216
The witch looked shocked.

37
00:02:34.217 --> 00:02:38.558
Slowly she lifted her finger.

38
00:02:38.559 --> 00:02:41.451
"Go ahead!" Rapunzel cried.

39
00:02:41.452 --> 00:02:46.721
"Do it! Turn me into a hedgehog!"

40
00:02:46.722 --> 00:02:49.887
But the witch dropped her hand.

41
00:02:49.888 --> 00:02:57.744
"I'll be back tomorrow!" she growled.

42
00:02:57.745 --> 00:03:05.320
Then she flew off into the dark forest.

43
00:03:05.321 --> 00:03:10.673
Rapunzel fell to her knees. "Oh, Prickle!"

44
00:03:10.674 --> 00:03:15.559
She sobbed and pulled the hedgehog from her pocket.

45
00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:24.700
"We are trapped in this tower forever!"

